    "id": 344519,
    "name": "Gilbert Ski Chalet | 3 min to Catamount!",
    "description": "Experience the ultimate family ski getaway at this spacious 4-bedroom, 3-bath home across from Catamount Ski Area. With large picture windows framing stunning views, the open design  feels airy and inviting—perfect for gathering after a day on the slopes. Relax in the cozy living area or soak in the jacuzzi tub on the second floor. Whether skiing or exploring The Berkshires, this home offers the ideal retreat for your next mountain adventure!\n\n✔ Self check‑in with smartlock\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen + washer/dryer\n✔ High-speed Wi‑Fi\n✔ Jacuzzi tub\n✔ BBQ Grill\n✔ Free parking on premises\n✔ Coffee & linens included\n✔ Bathroom Essentials\n✔ Open living & play spaces\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ 3 mins to Catamount Ski Area\n➥ 6 mins to Harlem Valley Rail Trail\n➥ 11 mins to W.E.B Du Bois Home Site\n➥ 15 mins to The Mahaiwe\n➥ 15 mins to Bash Bish Falls\n➥ 21 mins to Butternut Ski Area\n➥ 23 mins to Bartholomew's Cobble\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 King bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 3 - 1 Queen bed\nShared Space - 1 Twin trundle bed\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshire vacation rental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\nNo pets of any kind allowed at this home. Emotional support animals are not allowed. By law service animals are allowed. If you are planning on bringing a service animal please reach out to us ahead of time so we can verify paperwork. If a pet is brought on the premises without alerting us the reservation will be cancelled.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking three cars in the driveway. Please note, road and driveway of the property are gravel / dirt. Make sure to have an AWD equipped car in the winter months.",
