    "description": "Welcome to one of the best lakeside spots in The Berkshires! This spacious house features a stunning private dock perfect for swimming and vast open grounds ideal for entertaining. Enjoy the cozy fireplaces and send the kids over to the guest house for movie time, which sleeps 2 and includes its own wood stove. With an open floor plan on the main level and a spacious TV room in the basement, this property is the perfect retreat for family and friends to create unforgettable memories together!\n\n✔ Private dock\n✔ Separate Guesthouse (4th bedroom: only included in the booking from Memorial Day Weekend through Columbus Day Weekend)\n✔ Jacuzzi tub\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ Smart TV\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Air conditioning\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ LAKEFRONT !\n➥ 8 mins to Beartown State Forest\n➥ 13 mins to Ski Butternut\n➥ 18 mins to The Mahaiwe / Downtown Great Barrington\n➥ 20 mins to The Berkshire Theatre Group\n➥ 20 mins to The Lion's Den\n➥ 20 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 20 mins to Shakespeare and Co.\n➥ 20 mins to Jacob's Pillow\n➥ 30 mins to Catamount Ski\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 2 Single beds\nBedroom 2 - 1 King bed\nBedroom 3 - 1 Queen bed\nShared Space - 1 Murphy bed in the cabin\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\n• DOGS: Your dog is welcome and there is a one time fee of $100. Please include your pet in the booking so we know ahead of time. Max of 2 dogs. No other types of animals are authorized.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking multiple cars in the driveway. Please note, road and driveway of the property are gravel / dirt. Make sure to have an AWD equipped car in the winter months.  \n\nPlease note that the cottage (4th bedroom) is only available from Memorial Day through Columbus Day. We shut this down and winterize during the colder months.",
    "houseRules": "As hosts, we generally like to abide by the golden rule. Treat our space well, and we'll treat you well in return. \nno smoking\nno overnight guests beyond those outlined in the booking\nno parties\nplease respect all quiet hours\nPlease see guest packet for more information.",
