    "description": "Welcome to Friendly Hills, a one-of-a-kind Mid-Century home nestled on 6 private acres. Built in the 1950s by GE engineer Willard F.M. Gray, this passive solar retreat offers panoramic views, triple-pane windows, and ceramic tile floors that retain heat year-round. Enjoy direct access to private hiking trails, peaceful ponds, and nearby Hancock Shaker Village. Fast Wi-Fi, thoughtful design, and natural beauty make this perfect for families, couples, and nature lovers alike.\n\n✔ Guest pass to Hancock Shaker Village INCLUDED\n✔ EV Charger: High-speed Level 2\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ Cats and dogs allowed\n✔ Extra bedding\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Outdoor firepit\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Direct access to private hiking trails, peaceful ponds\n✔ Corn hole boards, Saucer sleds, and Picnic table & chairs\n✔ Weddings/events & Pet-friendly\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ 1 mins to Hancock Shaker Village\n➥ 7 mins to Lenox Mountain\n➥ 7 mins to Bousquet Mountain Ski Area\n➥ 11 mins to Barrington Stage\n➥ 9 mins to Berkshire Museum\n➥ 13 mins to Pittsfield State Forest\n➥ 13 mins to Olivia's Overlook at Yokun Ridge Reserve\n➥ 14 mins to Lake Onota\n➥ 16 mins to Tanglewood\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 3 - 2 Twin beds\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\n• Pets: Your cats and dogs are welcome, one-time fee of $100. Please include your pets in the booking so we know ahead of time. Max of 2 pets. No other types of animals are authorized.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking multiple cars in the driveway. A Level 2 high-speed electric car charger with a 25' cable, featuring both J1772 and NACS (Tesla) plugs, is in the garage for indoor or outdoor charging.",
