    "id": 392704,
    "name": "Mac Shores | 5 min to Tanglewood! • Shared Beach",
    "description": "Welcome to our funky little summer cottage! Tucked in a stone's throw from the Stockbridge Bowl and just down the street from Tanglewood, this home offers convenient access to fun in The Berkshires. Whether you’re at the lake, Tanglewood, or relaxing on the porch, there's something for everyone. Bright, modern, and charming, it's the ideal spot to make memories with loved ones.! Enjoy the best that The Berkshires have to offer at this peaceful and centrally-located cottage.\n\n✔ Self check‑in\n✔ Lake access\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ TV\n✔ Fully equipped Kitchen\n✔ Coffee maker\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ BBQ Grill\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ < 1 mins to Mahk Shores Private Beach\n➥ 3 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 5 mins to The Mount, Edith Wharton's Home\n➥ 6 mins to The Lion's Den\n➥ 7 mins to Berkshire Botanical Garden\n➥ 7 mins to Shakespeare & Company\n➥ 7 mins to Kennedy Park\n➥ 8 mins to The Berkshire Theatre\n➥ 9 mins to Norman Rockwell Museum\n➥ 10 mins to Chesterwood\n➥ 12 mins to October Mountain State Forest\n➥ 13 mins to Bousquet Mountain Ski Area\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 3 bedrooms and 1 bathroom, all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Full bed\nBedroom 3 - 2 Twin beds\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\nNo pets of any kind allowed at this home. Emotional support animals are not allowed. By law service animals are allowed. If you are planning on bringing a service animal please reach out to us ahead of time so we can verify paperwork. If a pet is brought on the premises without alerting us the reservation will be cancelled.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nParking is VERY TIGHT in Mahkeenac Shores. Please carpool whenever possible. There is only parking FOR TWO CARS MAXIMUM in the driveway. There is no additional parking inside Mahkeenac Shores. Any cars beyond two will need to be parked in the town of Stockbridge.",
    "houseRules": "As hosts, we generally like to abide by the golden rule. Treat our space well, and we'll treat you well in return. \nno smoking\nno overnight guests beyond those outlined in the booking\nno parties\nplease respect all quiet hours\nPlease see guest packet for more information.",
