    "description": "Welcome to our rustic summer cottage—quaint, quirky, and perfectly imperfect! Nestled right at the  Stockbridge Bowl in the Berkshires, it’s the spot for water lovers and Tanglewood fans alike. With more charm than shiny new, this cozy retreat is ideal for those who appreciate rustic charm and a splash of personality. Just 3 minutes from Tanglewood, it’s a step back in time where moments with family abound and good times float freely!\n\n✔ Lake Access\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ TV\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Sun loungers\n✔ BBQ Grill\n✔ Pet-friendly\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ < 1 min to Mahk Shores Private Beach\n➥ 3 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 6 mins to The Mount, Edith Wharton's Home\n➥ 7 mins to Shakespeare & Company\n➥ 7 mins Olivia's Overlook at Yokun Ridge Reserve\n➥ 7 mins to Berkshire Botanical Garden\n➥ 7 mins to The Lion's Den\n➥ 8 mins to Kennedy Park\n➥ 8 mins to The Berkshire Theater\n➥ 9 mins to Norman Rockwell Museum\n➥ 10 mins to Laurel Lake\n➥ 10 mins to Chesterwood\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 Twin bed & 1 Double bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 3 - 1 Double bed\nShared Space - 1 Twin bed\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshire vacation rental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\n• DOGS: Your dog is welcome and there is a one time fee of $100. Please include your pet in the booking so we know ahead of time. Max of 2 dogs. No other types of animals are authorized.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nParking is VERY TIGHT in Mahkeenac Shores. Please carpool whenever possible. There is parking FOR TWO CARS MAXIMUM in the designated spot directly in front of the home. There is no additional parking inside Mahkeenac Shores. Any cars beyond two will need to be parked in the town of Stockbridge. \n\n***IMPORTANT NOTE, WE ARE NOT ALLOWED TO HAVE TRASH CANS AT THE COTTAGE. ALL GUESTS WILL NEED TO BRING THEIR TRASH TO THE TOWN DUMP, JUST A FEW MINUTES DOWN THE ROAD.",
