    "description": "Get away to this peaceful Berkshire escape tucked into the woods of Pixley Hill in West Stockbridge! The home boasts 3 full bedrooms as well as a smaller kids room and two extra special twin beds in a fun lofted space that feels like a campout even for the biggest of kids. Enjoy a night tucked in by the fireplace or a lazy Sunday lounging in the tub connected to the master bedroom. If being nestled away in the woods but still only 15 minutes to Tanglewood is your thing, hurry up and book today!\n\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ Smart TV\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Wood fireplace\n✔ Pellet stove\n✔ Sunroom\n✔ Pet-friendly\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ 7 mins to Chesterwood\n➥ 10 mins to Berkshire Botanical Garden\n➥ 10 mins to Norman Rockwell Museum\n➥ 11 mins to Olivia's Overlook at Yokun Ridge Reserve\n➥ 12 mins to The Lion's Den\n➥ 13 mins to The Mahaiwe\n➥ 14 mins to The Berkshire Theatre\n➥ 14 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 15 mins to Stockbridge Bowl\n➥ 15 mins to Ski Butternut\n➥ 15 mins to W.E.B. Du Bois National Historic Site\n➥ 16 mins to Lenox Mountain\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 3 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 4: 3 Twin beds\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\n• DOGS: Your dog is welcome and there is a one time fee of $100. Please include your pet in the booking so we know ahead of time. Max of 2 dogs. No other types of animals are authorized.\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking multiple cars in the driveway. Please note, road and driveway of the property are gravel / dirt. Make sure to have an AWD equipped car in the winter months.",
