    "name": "St Anne's Manor | Walk to Downtown! • Sleeps 8",
    "description": "Step back in time into this beautifully curated victorian built in the late 1800's right in downtown Lenox. If a simple life in The Berkshires is your dream, look no further. High ceilings, multiple fireplaces, and a large eat in kitchen will work their wonders on you. Slow down, nestle in, and relax, your one of a kind getaway to The Berkshires awaits you. Look no further, and book today before it's too late! \n\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ TV\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Indoor fireplace\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Multiple fireplaces\n✔ Secluded backyard with perennial borders\n✔ BBQ Grill\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ In downtown Lenox!\n➥ 3 mins to Kennedy Park\n➥ 5 mins to Shakespeare & Company\n➥ 5 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 6 mins to The Mount, Edith Wharton's Home\n➥ 7 mins to Olivia's Overlook at Yokun Ridge Reserve\n➥ 8 mins to Stockbridge Bowl\n➥ 9 mins to Bousquet Mountain Ski Area\n➥ 10 mins to October Mountain State Forest\n➥ 14 mins to Lenox Mountain\n➥ 16 mins to Hancock Shaker Village\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 King bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 3 - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 4 - 2 Single beds\nBedroom 5 - 1 Single bed\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\nNo pets of any kind allowed at this home. Emotional support animals are not allowed. By law service animals are allowed. If you are planning on bringing a service animal please reach out to us ahead of time so we can verify paperwork. If a pet is brought on the premises without alerting us the reservation will be cancelled.\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking two cars in the driveway. Any additional cars will need to be parked in the church lot at the bottom of St Anne's street. \n\nThere are many helpful accouterments in the house to make your stay more \"home like\".\nIn the kitchen, count on the usual fridge door condiments + pantry staples, sugar, flour ( if you're into baking) coffee filters, tea bags, oils and vinegar etc. Help yourself , but please  replace anything that you \"use up\"!\nPlease ask if you need more specifics .",
