    "name": "Pine & Paddle | Pond Access • Kayaks",
    "description": "Come enjoy all The Berkshires have to offer at our chic country cottage! Imagine relaxing by the cozy wood stove after a day spent exploring. With two bedrooms and a fresh bathroom, it’s perfect for a peaceful getaway. A short walk brings you to a private community beach on Richmond Pond, or enjoy music at nearby Tanglewood and winter skiing and tubing at Bousquet. Whether you’re here for relaxation or adventure, our inviting home  is perfectly located to make your stay memorable.\n\n✔ High-speed Wi-Fi\n✔ TV\n✔ Fully equipped kitchen\n✔ Washer & dryer\n✔ Free parking\n✔ Wood-burning fireplace\n✔ Kayak & Lake access\n✔ BBQ Grill\n✔ Pet-friendly\n✔ Pack n Play Travel Crib (Upon request)\n\n➥ 3 mins to Lenox Mountain\n➥ 5 mins to Bousquet Mountain Ski Area\n➥ 7 mins to Hancock Shaker Village\n➥ 9 mins to The Colonial Theatre: Berkshire Theatre Group\n➥ 9 mins to Berkshire Museum\n➥ 9 mins to Olivia's Overlook at Yokun Ridge Reserve\n➥ 12 mins to Tanglewood\n➥ 14 mins to Stockbridge Bowl\n➥ 16 mins to The Mount, Edith Wharton's Home\n➥ 17 mins to Shakespeare & Company\n\n✦BEDS & BATHS✦\nInside we have 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom, all decorated tastefully to give the full nostalgic Berkshire travel experience.\n\nRoom Breakdown:\nMain Bedroom - 1 Queen bed\nBedroom 2 - 1 Queen bed\n\nAll Berkshire Vacation Rental Co.™ Properties include:\n - Support from full-time local team available daily from 9am to 9pm\n - Professional housekeeping & property inspection prior to guest arrival\n - Towels, linens, and bath products\n - At least a mornings worth of coffee to get you started\n - Learn more @berkshirevacationrental\n\nCleaning Protocols: As THE professional management company in The Berkshires we take pride in our professional cleaning standards between guests. We pay above the living wage & 100% of your cleaning fee is paid directly to the individual cleaner responsible for your property.\n\n• DOGS: Your dog is welcome and there is a one time fee of $100. Please include your pet in the booking so we know ahead of time. Max of 1 dog. No other types of animals are authorized.\n\nTo provide a high level of security and safety all Berkshire Vacation Rental Co. properties are equipped with a security camera facing the parking area.\n\nThere is space for parking two cars in the driveway. Please note, road and driveway of the property are gravel / dirt. Make sure to have an AWD equipped car in the winter months.",
    "houseRules": "As hosts, we generally like to abide by the golden rule. Treat our space well, and we'll treat you well in return. \nno smoking\nno overnight guests beyond those outlined in the booking\nno parties\nplease respect all quiet hours\nPlease see guest packet for more information.",
